iginal/The-Audacious-Project-logo.jpg","link_text":"Learn more","link_url":"https://audaciousproject.org/"}},"the+audacious+project":{"blurb":"The Audacious Project is TED\'s initiative to fund ambitious ideas for social good.","sidebar":{"heading":"Learn more about The Audacious Project","image_url":"https://pb-assets.tedcdn.com/system/baubles/files/000/006/293/original/The-Audacious-Project-logo.jpg","link_text":"Learn more","link_url":"https://audaciousproject.org/"}},"bacteria":{"blurb":"Watch TED Talks and find articles about bacteria -- how they communicate, how they interact with us, and how they grow."},"body+language":{"blurb":"Stand like Wonder Woman before an interview, or smile to de-stress -- learn more about your body language."},"brain":{"blurb":"How does the brain work? How does it create inventions, the feeling of hunger, the sense of self? Watch these TED talks on the latest science of how we think."},"business":{"sidebar":{"heading":"TED Books","title":"Beyond Measure: The Big Impact of Small Changes","image_url":"https://pb-assets.tedcdn.com/system/baubles/files/000/002/545/original/TEDBooks_Heffernan_product_hero.jpg","byline":"by Margaret Heffernan","description":"In this powerful manifesto for for CEOs and managers alike, Heffernan looks back over decades spent overseeing different organizations and comes to a counterintuitive conclusion: it\'s the small shifts that have the greatest impact.","link_text":"Buy now","link_url":"http://geni.us/BeyondMeasure?track=topics"}},"cancer":{"blurb":"Understanding cancer, preventing it -- and ending it. Watch these TED Talks about the latest science and technology in the fight against cancer."},"cities":{"blurb":"In these TED Talks, explore the crowded favelas, greened-up blocks and futuristic districts that will shape the future of cities -- and the future of humanity."},"climate+change":{"blurb":"Climate change: It\'s real, and our response will take two forms: slowing it down if we can ... and learning to live with the change we can\'t stop anymore.  Watch these TED Talks for a primer on the issue of our times."},"consumerism":{"blurb":"Watch TED Talks on consumerism, buying and selling."},"corruption":{"blurb":"Some of the world\'s most baffling problems can be traced to corruption. These TED Talks -- from analysts, journalists and whistleblowers -- offer real-world solutions from around the world."},"countdown":{"blurb":"Countdown is TED’s global initiative to accelerate solutions to the climate crisis. The goal: to build a better future by cutting greenhouse gas emissions in half by 2030, in the race to a zero-carbon world. Learn more about how you can take action on climate change at countdown.ted.com."},"creativity":{"blurb":"Where does creativity come from? How can you nurture your own? Watch TED Talks from creative people like Steve Jobs, architect Frank Gehry, designer Philippe Starck, writer Elizabeth Gilbert and more."},"design":{"blurb":"In these TED Talks, some of the world\'s greatest designers share their creative process. Hear from Philippe Starck, Frank Gehry, Stefan Sagmeister, Paula Scher, MoMA\'s Paola Antonelli and more.","sidebar":{"heading":"TED Books","title":"Judge This","image_url":"https://pb-assets.tedcdn.com/system/baubles/files/000/002/558/original/TEDBooks_Kidd_product_shot.jpg","byline":"by Chip Kidd","description":"Designer Chip Kidd reveals the hidden secrets behind design choices, and, along the way, shows how so much of our world can be a dazzling magic show, a seductive work of art, and a sublime experience -- if we have the tools to judge it.","link_text":"Buy now","link_url":"http://geni.us/JudgeThis?track=topics"}},"education":{"blurb":"How do we reinvent education? These TED Talks explore the latest thinking — from teachers, parents, kids — on how to build a better school.","sidebar":{"title":"Explore TED-Ed","image_url":"https://pi.tedcdn.com/r/pb-assets.tedcdn.com/system/baubles/files/000/001/323/original/TEDEd-TopicsUnit.jpg","description":"Watch or customize a lesson, and explore TED-Ed\'s growing library of educational resources!","link_text":"Learn more","link_url":"https://ed.ted.com"}},"faith":{"blurb":"A collection of TED Talks on the topic of faith and belief -- and doubt."},"food":{"blurb":"These TED talks -- from chefs, farmers, restaurant owners, cookbook writers and foodies -- celebrate all things edible. And ask the important question: What\'s wrong with what we eat?"},"gaming":{"blurb":"Watch TED Talks about video games, toys and board games -- and talks about using the mechanics of games in real life."},"happiness":{"blurb":"We all want to be happy. But how, exactly, do you go about it? The answers in these TED Talks on happiness -- from psychologists, journalists and monks -- may surprise you."},"humor":{"blurb":"These TED Talks, covering every topic under the sun, have one thing in common: They\'re laugh-out-loud funny."},"india":{"blurb":"TED Talks and stories about India. Visit our special TED India page to explore even more great talks in both Hindi and English!"},"insects":{"blurb":"Dung beetles, ants, dragonflies, bees and more! Watch TED Talks about amazing insects."},"leadership":{"blurb":"What makes a great leader? These TED Talks -- from soldiers and psychologists, athletes and entrepreneurs -- share hard-won wisdom on leadership.","sidebar":{"heading":"TED Books","title":"Beyond Measure","image_url":"https://pb-assets.tedcdn.com/system/baubles/files/000/002/545/original/TEDBooks_Heffernan_product_hero.jpg","byline":"by Margaret Heffernan","description":"How can organizations make important changes? Margaret Heffernan\'s book reveals it\'s the small shifts that have the greatest impact.","link_text":"Buy now","link_url":"http://geni.us/BeyondMeasure?track=topics"}},"love":{"blurb":"Why and how do we fall in love? In these TED Talks, scientists, psychologists, poets and painters explore the mystery of romance."},"magic":{"blurb":"In these TED Talks, the worl